# Cloudflare Pages Direct Upload deploys the raw directory as-is — it does
# NOT read .gitignore, so anything here that shouldn't be publicly served
# at nhopnhep.pages.dev must be listed explicitly.
#
# The community backend and internal roadmap docs used to live inside this
# folder but were moved out entirely (../NhopNhep-community-server,
# ../NhopNhep-docs) after wrangler tried to upload a 52MB binary from
# inside them — Pages caps individual files at 25MB and this ignore file
# doesn't appear to be honored by `wrangler pages deploy` in this version,
# so "not present in the deployed directory" is the only reliable guard.

# Claude Code project tooling config, not app content
.claude/

# One-off local patch scripts, never meant to ship
update_*.js

# Dev/build noise
node_modules/
.wrangler/
.netlify/
.env
.env.local
